t actions.\n\nrestart: Restart the agent process (clean shutdown).\n\nclearChat: Clear the conversation history.\n\nstats: Report current health, food, position, gamemode, biome, time, weather, and nearby players.\n\ninventory: List all items in the bot's inventory with counts.\n\ngoal: Report the current pathfinding goal, if any.\n\nentities: List nearby players and entities with positions and types.\n\nnearbyBlocks: List block types near the bot.\n\ncraftable: List all items craftable with current inventory.\n\nhelp: List all available commands.\n\nmodes: Show all available behavior modes and their status.\n\nmoveTo: Move the bot to the given coordinates.\n  Params:\n    x: (float) X coordinate\n    y: (float) Y coordinate\n    z: (float) Z coordinate\n\ngoToPlayer: Navigate to the given player.\n  Params:\n    player_name: (string) Player name to go to\n    closeness: (float) How close to get (default 3)\n\nfollowPlayer: Continuously follow a player.\n  Params:\n    player_name: (string) Player name to follow\n    follow_dist: (float) Following distance (default 4)\n\ngoToCoordinates: Move to specific x, y, z coordinates.\n  Params:\n    x: (float) X coordinate\n    y: (float) Y coordinate\n    z: (float) Z coordinate\n    closeness: (float) How close to get (default 2)\n\nsearchForBlock: Find and navigate to the nearest block of the given type.\n  Params:\n    block_type: (string) Block type, e.g. oak_log\n    search_range: (float) Search radius (default 64)\n\nsearchForEntity: Find and navigate to the nearest entity of the given type.\n  Params:\n    entity_type: (string) Entity type, e.g. cow\n    search_range: (float) Search radius (default 64)\n\nmoveAway: Move in a random direction by the given distance.\n  Params:\n    distance: (float) Distance to move (default 16)\n\ngoToBed: Find the nearest bed and sleep in it.\n\ngoToSurface: Navigate upward to the surface.\n\ndigDown: Dig straight down, stopping at lava/water/bedrock.\n  Params:\n    distance: (int) Max distance to dig (default 10)\n\nstay: Stay in place. Pauses all modes.\n  Params:\n    seconds: (int) Seconds to stay (-1 = indefinite)\n\nattack: Attack and kill the nearest hostile entity of the given type.\n  Params:\n    entity_type: (string) Entity type, e.g. zombie\n\nattackPlayer: Attack a specific player until they die or flee.\n  Params:\n    player_name: (string) Player name to attack\n\nequip: Equip an item to the given body slot.\n  Params:\n    item_name: (string) Item to equip, e.g. diamond_sword\n\nconsume: Eat or drink the given item.\n  Params:\n    item_name: (string) Item to consume, e.g. cooked_beef\n\ndiscard: Discard items from inventory.\n  Params:\n    item_name: (string) Item to discard\n    num: (int) Number to discard (-1 = all)\n\ngivePlayer: Navigate to a player and give them items.\n  Params:\n    player_name: (string) Player to give to\n    item_name: (string) Item to give\n    num: (int) Number to give (default 1)\n\nplaceHere: Place a block from inventory at the current position.\n  Params:\n    block_type: (string) Block type to place\n\nactivateBlock: Right-click / activate the nearest block of the given type.\n  Params:\n    block_type: (string) Block type, e.g. lever\n\ncollectBlocks: Mine and collect blocks of the specified type.\n  Params:\n    blockType: (string) Block type, e.g. oak_log\n    count: (int) Number to collect\n\nuseOn: Use a tool on a target entity or block.\n  Params:\n    tool_name: (string) Tool to use, e.g. bucket\n    target: (string) Target entity/block or 'nothing'/'hand'\n\nviewChest: Show contents of the nearest chest.\n\nputInChest: Store items in the nearest chest.\n  Params:\n    item_name: (string) Item to store\n    num: (int) Number to store (-1 = all)\n\ntakeFromChest: Take items from the nearest chest.\n  Params:\n    item_name: (string) Item to take\n    num: (int) Number to take (-1 = all)\n\ncraftRecipe: Craft a recipe using available materials. Some recipes (beds, tools, armor, etc.) require a placed crafting table nearby. Use getCraftingPlan to see the full ingredient tree and requirements before crafting.\n  Params:\n    recipe_name: (string) Item to craft, e.g. stick\n    num: (int) Number to craft (default 1)\n\nsmeltItem: Smelt items in a furnace. Requires a furnace nearby and fuel + input items in inventory.\n  Params:\n    item_name: (string) Item to smelt, e.g. raw_iron\n    num: (int) Number to smelt (default 1)\n\nclearFurnace: Clear all items from the nearest furnace.\n\nshowVillagerTrades: Show trades for a villager by entity ID.\n  Params:\n    villager_id: (int) Villager entity ID\n\ntradeWithVillager: Execute a trade with a villager.\n  Params:\n    villager_id: (int) Villager entity ID\n    trade_index: (int) Trade number (1-based)\n    count: (int) Number of trades to execute\n\nlookAtPlayer: Look at a player or in the same direction as a player.\n  Params:\n    player_name: (string) Player to look at\n\nlookAtPosition: Look at specific coordinates.\n  Params:\n    x: (float) X coordinate\n    y: (float) Y coordinate\n    z: (float) Z coordinate\n\nsetMode: Enable or disable a behavior mode.\n  Params:\n    mode_name: (string) Mode name\n    on: (bool) True to enable, False to disable\n\nsetGoal: Set a goal message for persistent self-prompting.\n  Params:\n    self_prompt: (string) Goal message for self-prompting\n\nendGoal: End the current goal and stop self-prompting.\n\npickupNearbyItems: Pick up all nearby dropped items on the ground.\n  Params:\n    distance: (float) Pickup radius (default 8)\n\ntillAndSow: Till the ground at coordinates and optionally plant seeds.\n  Params:\n    x: (float) X coordinate to till\n    y: (float) Y coordinate to till\n    z: (float) Z coordinate to till\n    seed_type: (string) Seed type to plant, e.g. wheat_seeds (optional)\n\nuseDoor: Open a door, walk through it, and close it.\n  Params:\n    x: (float) X coordinate of door (optional, finds nearest)\n    y: (float) Y coordinate of door (optional)\n    z: (float) Z coordinate of door (optional)\n\ngetCraftingPlan: Get a comprehensive crafting plan for a target item. Shows required ingredients with exact quantities, what you already have, and what you still need to gather. Always use this before crafting complex items to know which intermediate steps are needed.\n  Params:\n    target_item: (string) The item to craft, e.g. diamond_sword\n    quantity: (int) Quantity to craft (default 1)\n\nsearchWiki: Search the Minecraft Wiki for info about an item, block, or mechanic.\n  Params:\n    query: (string) The search query, e.g. 'enchanting table'\n\nstartConversation: Start a conversation with another player.\n  Params:\n    player_name: (string) Player to talk to\n    message: (string) Message to send\n\nendConversation: End the current conversation.\n  Params:\n    player_name: (string) Player to stop talking to\n\n*\n\nConversation Begin:"
